Subject: Nightingale Update - Priority One

Agent Kepler,

Received your comm regarding the Bucharest anomaly. Situation is…complicated. The “collector,” as locals refer to him, isn’t dealing in antiquities as initially reported. It’s biological material. Specifically, highly modified avian DNA. Think accelerated evolution, weaponized migratory patterns. The samples aren’t just rare birds, Kepler, they *shouldn’t exist*. 

I’ve managed to infiltrate his inner circle posing as a prospective buyer – a Swiss ornithologist with… questionable funding. The operation is masked as a private aviary, but the security is far beyond anything a hobbyist would require. Laser grids, pressure plates, the works. And the staff… they aren’t bird enthusiasts. They’re ex-Spetsnaz, judging by their movements and the subtle modifications to their equipment. 

