My current assessment is that Volkov intends to release these modified birds – a coordinated swarm – to disrupt communications networks. The avian DNA contains embedded nanites, capable of interfering with satellite signals and ground-based transmissions. It’s a sophisticated attack vector, designed to cripple infrastructure without a single shot fired. The projected range is continental.

I’ve located the primary holding facility – an abandoned Cold War bunker beneath the aviary. Access is heavily guarded, but I’ve identified a potential weakness in the ventilation system. It’s a long shot, but it’s the only viable entry point without triggering a full alarm. I need immediate support. Specifically, a specialist in EMP technology. We need to disable the internal security systems before I can reach the core samples. 

Do *not* attempt direct contact. Volkov has eyes and ears everywhere. Utilize the dead drop at the clock tower – the usual protocol. I’ll be monitoring frequency Delta-9 for your confirmation. Time is critical. This isn’t just about containing a rogue collector anymore, Kepler. This is about preventing a global communications blackout. 

Be discreet. Be swift. And for God’s sake, watch the skies.

Nightingale.



